# Data lives outside the repository; scripts/fetch_data.py populates data/.
# No trailing slashes: a trailing slash matches directories ONLY, so these rules silently
# failed to match the symlinks used to point data/ at a local copy, and seven of them were
# committed with absolute cluster paths inside.
data/DREAMS_data
data/TNG_data
data/FIRE_data
data/checkpoints
data/figure_cache
data/figures
data/anisotropy_*

